BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Mountains-to-Sea Trail Hiking Club
UID:event_315951641@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260807T032001Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260814T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260814T110000
SUMMARY:Warren Wilson Berea Baptist Church Hike
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Mountains-to-Sea Trail Hiking Club 2.0\nWe'll meet a
 t 9:00 a.m. on Riceville Road\, across from Berea Baptist church and plan 
 to leave no later than 9:10 a.m.\n\nWe'll hike in the woods along the Bull
  Creek Trail and over to the Swannanoa River trail and back. This is a gen
 tly undulating hike through serene woods and along peaceful waterways. We 
 hike at about 3.2 mph.\n\nThen length of this trail is 5-6 miles\, dependi
 ng upon how far we hike along the river\; and we will return to the cars b
 y 11:00 to 11:15. Well behaved dogs on leashes are welcome.\n\nMountains-t
 o-Sea-Trail hikes are designed for fitness and community among people who 
 are already reasonably fit. It's not an endurance hike by any means\, but 
 it is designed so we can get our hearts beating a bit while still being ab
 le to have a conversation and meet new people. The typical pace for a hike
  of this sort is 3.0 to 3.2 mph.\n\nWhen you arrive\, we'll circle up and 
 introduce ourselves briefly. It's a pretty rigorous pace and we only take 
 one break. Plan accordingly.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-mountains-to-sea-trail-hiki
 ng-club/events/315951641/
